{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23411","headline":"翫止水 · 白居易","name":"翫止水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"动者乐流水，静者乐止水。\n利物不如流，鉴形不如止。\n凄清早霜降，淅沥微风起。\n中面红叶开，四隅绿萍委。\n广狭八九丈，湾环有涯涘。\n浅深三四尺，洞彻无表里。\n净分鹤翘足，澄见鱼掉尾。\n迎眸洗眼尘，隔胷荡心滓。\n定将禅不别，明与诚相似。\n清能律贪夫，淡可交君子。\n岂唯空狎翫，亦取相伦拟。\n欲识静者心，心源只如此。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23411.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23411","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}